.TH "ORBIT" "1" "Aug 2026" "Orbit Developer Platform" "Orbit Platform Manual"

.SH NAME
.PP
orbit-status - Show git status and working tree cleanliness across workspace repositories


.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBorbit status [scope] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Inspects all cloned repositories and renders a colorized table of branch names, sync states (ahead/behind), and uncommitted changes.


.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for status

.PP
\fB--manifest\fP=""
	Path to workspace.yaml (default: /workspace.yaml)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
.PP
\fB--config\fP=""
	Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file


.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBorbit(1)\fP
